  "body": "People keep thinking that the admin endpoints are unspecified parts of Matrix, and not a Synapse implementation specific feature. At the very least, move them to `/_matrix/synapse-admin` or something to clearly flag them as Synapse endpoints, not Matrix.\r\n\r\nThe documentation is not helping with this either: many of the docs say `/_matrix/client/r0/admin/...` which implies that it should exist in r0.x of the spec.",
